<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="c512abbc">&lt;p&gt;
    The testing team will support the hot fix efforts by validating the fixes in the lower test environments and supporting
    regression testing.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Following the implementation of a hot fix, a quick or condensed regression test is performed to verify the fix hasn’t
    affected any other functionality. After this regression test is performed, the fix will be moved to the production
    environment for business or end user testing and sign off.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
